# GRAC-LM v0.4 — Model Checkpoints

## Overview

This directory documents the trained model checkpoints produced during GRAC-LM v0.4 research.

The model was independently trained using a custom GPT-style decoder-only Transformer architecture.

**Research status:** Paused after Cell 81 on October 8, 2026.

