## Checkpoint Storage

All five checkpoints were verified during Cell 81.

The original checkpoint files are preserved in the project's Google Drive directory:

`GRAC/GRAC-LM-v0.4/`

The model weights are not included in this GitHub repository's initial research archive.

## Model Architecture

- Parameters: approximately 54.7 million
- Vocabulary size: 8,000
- Context length: 512 tokens
- Transformer layers: 10
- Attention heads: 10
- Embedding dimension: 640

## Evaluation

The final Phase 4D diagnostic reported:

- Training sample accuracy: 10/120 (8.3%)
- Held-out validation accuracy: 3/59 (5.1%)
- QA validation loss: 1.1796

These results demonstrate limited question-answering generalization despite improvements in training objectives.

## Future Development

Checkpoint preservation allows GRC to resume independent language-model research after GRAC Assistant is launched and stabilized.

Future GRAC-LM versions will be documented in this repository.

